; `test_sop_execution_stress` (same asserts, differing only in its
; ~suite: telemetry string). It was deleted 2026-08-12: a suite counted
; twice inflates the battery denominator with zero added information,
; and `ops_verify.ml:82` derives that denominator from the `test_*.ml`
; glob, so removing the source removes the claim without a phantom skip.

